{"timestamp":"2026-10-03T06:52:12.978Z","ordinal":10719,"type":"event_msg","payload":{"type":"item_completed","thread_id":"01a0fd98-2f5c-78c3-9769-86fbf8a6fc22","turn_id":"01a10063-c779-76d1-8a4c-5f724176c155","item":{"type":"AgentMessage","id":"msg_08092949d98b672f016ac0a618e56087d2a6da89fb0ab10537","content":[{"type":"Text","text":"I’m doing it. The latest 10-minute run failed: it averaged 54.1 FPS and fell to 45.3 FPS over the worst 10-second window. I’m validating a change that reduces shadow-rendering work while preserving the geometry and visible detail. It has passed the image checks so far; sustained performance is still unproven."}],"phase":"commentary"},"started_at_ms":1791010329027,"completed_at_ms":1791010332978}}
